<link rel="stylesheet" href="<?=asset('css/communication.css')?>"><main class="write-main comm-main"><header class="comm-heading"><div><span class="writer-kicker">Explicit private mailbox access</span><h1>Email conversations</h1><p>Read your inbox when needed and prepare branded drafts for review in Gmail.</p></div><a class="wbtn" href="<?=url('/write/communication?tab=inbox')?>">Communication Centre</a></header><?php if($error):?><p class="notice error" role="alert"><?=e($error)?></p><?php endif;?><?php if($draft):?><p class="notice" role="status"><?=$draft['status']==='created'?'A private draft was created in '.e($draft['account']).'. Review and send it in Gmail.':'Draft creation is unconfirmed. Check Gmail before trying again.'?> No email has been sent by this action.</p><?php endif;?>
<div class="comm-columns"><section class="comm-panel"><h2>Inbox</h2><p role="status"><?=e($readStatus['label'])?><?=$readStatus['account']!==''?' · '.e($readStatus['account']):''?></p><p>Calendar connections do not grant mailbox access. Connect email separately and confirm the returned account.</p><form method="post" action="<?=url('/write/connections/google_gmail_read/start')?>"><?=csrf_field()?><button class="wbtn">Connect Gmail read access</button></form><p><a href="<?=url('/write/connections#google_gmail_read')?>">Confirm or review mailbox →</a></p><form method="post"><?=csrf_field()?><input type="hidden" name="action" value="read"><button class="wbtn primary" <?=$readStatus['ready']?'':'disabled'?>>Read 10 recent inbox messages</button></form><?php if($report):?><p>Account: <?=e($report['account'])?></p><?php if(!$report['messages']):?><p>No messages returned for this inbox read.</p><?php endif;?><?php foreach($report['messages']as$m):?><article class="comm-row"><h3><?=e($m['headers']['subject']??'(No subject)')?></h3><p><?=e($m['headers']['from']??'')?> · <?=e($m['headers']['date']??'')?></p><?php if(!empty($report['detail'])):?><pre class="mail-plain"><?=e($m['text']?:'This message has no supported plain-text body. Open it in Gmail.')?></pre><?php else:?><form method="post"><?=csrf_field()?><input type="hidden" name="action" value="read"><input type="hidden" name="message_id" value="<?=e($m['id'])?>"><button class="wbtn">Read message text</button></form><?php endif;?></article><?php endforeach;?><?php if(!empty($report['more'])):?><p>More messages exist. This is a bounded inbox view.</p><?php endif;?><?php endif;?><p class="comm-muted">Message bodies are not stored, cached offline or sent to AI. HTML, tracking images and attachments are not displayed.</p></section>
<section class="comm-panel"><h2>Prepare an email</h2><p role="status"><?=e($draftStatus['label'])?><?=$draftStatus['account']!==''?' · '.e($draftStatus['account']):''?></p><p>Draft access is separate. Google’s compose permission can also send mail, but this website creates drafts only.</p><form method="post" action="<?=url('/write/connections/google_gmail_draft/start')?>"><?=csrf_field()?><button class="wbtn">Connect Gmail draft access</button></form><p><a href="<?=url('/write/connections#google_gmail_draft')?>">Confirm draft destination →</a></p><form method="post"><?=csrf_field()?><input type="hidden" name="action" value="draft"><input type="hidden" name="request_id" value="<?=e(is_string($_POST['request_id']??null)?$_POST['request_id']:bin2hex(random_bytes(16)))?>"><label>Recipient first name<input name="name" maxlength="120" value="<?=e(is_string($_POST['name']??null)?$_POST['name']:'')?>" required></label><label>Recipient email<input type="email" name="to" value="<?=e(is_string($_POST['to']??null)?$_POST['to']:'')?>" maxlength="190" autocomplete="off" required></label><label>Subject<input name="subject" value="<?=e(is_string($_POST['subject']??null)?$_POST['subject']:'')?>" maxlength="180" required></label><label>Message<textarea name="body" rows="10" maxlength="12000" required><?=e(is_string($_POST['body']??null)?$_POST['body']:'')?></textarea></label><p>The saved draft includes your branded header, salutation and social/contact footer. Verify the recipient before sending in Gmail.</p><button class="wbtn primary" <?=$draftStatus['ready']?'':'disabled'?>>Create private Gmail draft</button></form><p><a href="https://mail.google.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Open Gmail ↗</a> · <a href="<?=url('/write/studio')?>">AI drafting tools</a></p><p class="comm-muted"><a href="https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/library/gmail.googleapis.com?project=waithaka-ndegwa-website-512516" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Gmail API setup</a> · <a href="<?=url('/write/connections#credentials')?>">Callback addresses</a>. Enable the Gmail API for this website’s Google Cloud project. Google verification or organisation policy may limit these mailbox permissions.</p></section></div></main>
